Error [jet.UnknownMethod]: `[Int?]` has no `filled`
  --> tests/ui/list_type_receiver_has_no_filled.jet:4:19
    |
  4 |     slots: [Int?].filled(3, None)
    |                   ^^^^^^
 Why: `[Int?]` before `.` is a list type, and a list type has no static methods; list statics belong to `List`
 Fix: Write the list literal `[Int?]{…}` for a list of values, or `[Int?#N].filled(value)` for a fixed array of N copies of one value
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0311
